@startuml
title US-001 - Register organization and admin - SD level 2
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over UI, API
  Credential input and session delivery are not yet specified.\nThis diagram shows the current draft contract only.
end note
Admin -> UI: Register organization and admin account
activate UI
UI -> API: POST /organizations (RegisterOrganizationDto)
activate API
alt Request accepted
    API --> UI: 201 Created (OrganizationDto)
else Invalid required details
    API --> UI: 400 Bad Request
else Email already registered
    API --> UI: 409 Conflict
else Persistence failure
    API --> UI: 500 Internal Server Error
end
deactivate API
alt Successful response
    UI --> Admin: Organization and admin account created
else Error response
    UI --> Admin: Show validation, authorization, or operation error
end
deactivate UI
@enduml
